                "title": "Emtek Single Cylinder Saratoga Deadbolt",
                "description": "A classically styled deadbolt, Emtek's Single Cylinder Saratoga Deadbolt has all the glamor one expects of traditional door hardware. This Oval Saratoga Deadbolt is easy to install fit doors 1-3/4 inches thick to 3 inches thick with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. A single cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a thumb turn on the interior and by a key from the exterior.",
